  "description": "The IVG XL35 Prefilled Pod Kit is designed for vapers who want extended performance in a convenient, rechargeable device. Built with a durable aluminium finish, the XL35 houses a powerful 1100mAh battery and a dual 1.1ohm mesh coil system for a reliable mouth-to-lung (MTL) vape. Each kit uses an innovative 22ml pod system, combining a 2ml base pod with two 10ml refill containers, capable of delivering up to 35,000 puffs in total. A built-in smart display keeps you in control, showing battery life, charging status, and the option to switch between Boost and Eco modes. Boost Mode delivers stronger flavour and denser vapour, while Eco Mode extends battery life for longer sessions between charges. Charging is handled by fast USB-C (cable sold separately), and pods are fitted easily using the mess-free auto-fill mechanism. Available in 15 flavour editions, the IVG XL35 range spans fruit, soda, and menthol blends to suit every taste: IVG XL35 Kit Flavours • Blue Raspberry Ice Tangy Blue Raspberry with a streak of ice-cool Menthol. • Blue Sour Raspberry A sharper take on Blue Raspberry with a tart, confectionery-inspired edge. • Cherry Peach Lemon Juicy Cherry and Peach brightened with citrusy Lemon. • Classic Menthol Clean, brisk Menthol for a straightforward cool vape. • Fizzy Cherry Sweet Cherry given a sparkling soda-style lift. • Green Apple Crisp and tart Green Apple with a refreshing bite. • Guava Pineapple Passionfruit A tropical trio blending sweet Guava, juicy Pineapple, and sharp Passionfruit. • Lemon and Lime Bright Lemon paired with zesty Lime for a citrus blast. • Peach Ice Sweet, ripe Peach with a cooling Ice layer. • Pineapple Ice Juicy Pineapple complemented by a frosty finish. • Pink Lemonade Sweet and tangy Pink Lemonade with a fizzy twist. • Retro Grape Full-bodied Grape with a sweet soda edge. • Strawberry Ice Classic Strawberry paired with a cool, icy lift. • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry A trio of ripe berries for a layered fruit profile. • Watermelon Strawberry Fresh Watermelon rounded with juicy Strawberry. How to Set Up Your IVG XL35 Kit: Step 1 Remove the red silicone stoppers and sticker from the pod parts. Step 2 Take the 2ml base pod and the two 10ml refill pods from the packaging. Step 3 Hold the refill pods side by side and align them with the top of the base pod. ✅ Ready to Vape! You're all set—enjoy your IVG XL35 experience. Step 4 Slide the refill pods downward until they click securely into place. Step 5 Insert the assembled pod into the device body until it locks in position Step 6 Once fitted, the dual mesh coil system will draw e-liquid from the refill pods into the 2ml chamber automatically, Shop IVG XL35 Refill Pods",
